  "title": "Braid groups and Hodge theory",
  "authors_raw": "Curtis T. McMullen",
  "title_lines": [
   "Braid groups and Hodge theory"
  ],
  "abstract": "This paper gives an account of the unitary representations of the braid group that arise via the Hodge theory of cyclic branched cover- ings of P1, highlighting their connections with ergodic theory, complex re\ufb02ection groups, moduli spaces of 1-forms and open problems in sur- face topology.",
